## 2. Functional Requirements

### Must-Have Features

#### Authentication Module
- User registration with name, email, password
- User login with email and password
- User logout (client-side token removal)
- JWT-based stateless authentication
- Password strength enforcement (uppercase, lowercase, digit, min 8 chars)
- Automatic logout on token expiration (401 response interceptor)

#### Event Browsing Module
- List all events with offset-based pagination (12 per page)
- Display: name, description, date/time, venue, category, total seats, available seats, price
- Filter events by category (music, tech, sports, comedy, art, food, theater, workshop, conference)
- View individual event detail page

#### Booking Module
- Book 1-10 seats for a future event (authenticated users only)
- Atomic seat decrement using MongoDB `findOneAndUpdate` with `$gte` guard
- View all personal bookings with event details
- Cancel a booking (only own bookings)
- Automatic seat release on cancellation
- Block booking for past events
- Block double-cancellation

#### Real-Time Module
- Socket.IO WebSocket connection per client
- Room-based subscriptions per event (`event:{id}`)
- Instant seat count broadcast on book/cancel
- Client-side cache patching (zero-flicker UI update)

### Good-to-Have Features

#### AI Search Module
- Natural language search input (e.g., "tech conferences next month")
- LLM-powered query parsing (Groq API → LLaMA 3.3 70B)
- Structured filter extraction: category, keyword, date range, seat constraints
- Parsed filter → MongoDB query execution
- Display parsed filters as visual badges

#### UX Polish
- Dark theme with glassmorphism design system
- Category-specific gradient color banners on event cards
- Animated seat availability progress bar with pulse indicator
- Confirmation modal before booking
- Toast notifications for all user actions
- Password visibility toggle
- Responsive mobile layout
- 404 page

### Future Scope

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| Admin panel | CRUD operations for events by organizers |
| Payment integration | Razorpay/Stripe for paid bookings |
| Email notifications | Booking confirmation, reminders |
| Event images | Image upload and storage (Cloudinary/S3) |
| User profiles | Avatar, booking history, preferences |
| Reviews & ratings | Post-event feedback |
| Waitlisting | Queue users when seats are sold out |
| Calendar integration | Export bookings to Google Calendar |
| Multi-role auth | Organizer, Admin, Attendee roles |

