## 9. System Architecture

### Layer Responsibilities

| Layer | Technology | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| **Presentation** | React 18 + Tailwind + Lucide | Render UI, handle user interactions, manage client state |
| **Client State** | Zustand (auth) + TanStack Query (server state) | Persist auth tokens, cache API responses, handle query lifecycle |
| **Transport** | Axios (HTTP) + Socket.IO Client (WebSocket) | API communication + real-time bidirectional event stream |
| **API Gateway** | Express.js + Middleware stack | Request routing, validation, authentication, rate limiting |
| **Business Logic** | Service layer (auth, booking, AI search) | Core domain logic, atomic operations, external API orchestration |
| **Data Access** | Mongoose ODM | Schema definition, query building, document-level atomic operations |
| **Persistence** | MongoDB Atlas | Document storage, indexing, data durability |
| **Real-Time** | Socket.IO Server | Event room management, broadcast seat updates |
| **AI/ML** | Groq API (LLaMA 3.3 70B) | Natural language → structured query parsing |

